<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/future-learning-ecosystem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A vision of learning as a connected, lifelong continuum rather than a series of disconnected episodes, with experiences tailored to individuals across locations, media, organizations, and periods of time." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/future-learning-ecosystem/versions/1> .
